License scope for this vendored multi-package tree
=================================================

`vikit_common/package.xml` and `vikit_ros/package.xml` declare GPLv3. The
`LICENSE` file in this directory is the verbatim GNU GPL version 3 text and is
intended for those two packages.

`vikit_py/package.xml` declares BSD. No complete package-level BSD text was
found in this tree; the presence of the GPLv3 `LICENSE` here does not relicense
`vikit_py`.

Per-file notices in `vikit_common` (for example PTAM/Isis Innovation and
Christian Kerl/dvo notices) remain in effect. See the repository-level
`THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md` for the unresolved GPLv2-only/GPLv3 combined-work
question.
